      "title": "Ensure access is controlled through SSO and not AWS IAM defined users",
      "resource": "aws_iam_user.privesc15-PassExistingRoleToNewLambdaThenInvoke-user",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "explanation": "AWS IAM users are less secure compared to using AWS SSO or federated access. They require long-term credentials, which increase the risk of credential leakage or misuse."
