  "patched_code": "resource \"aws_iam_user\" \"privesc15-PassExistingRoleToNewLambdaThenInvoke-user\" {\n  name = \"privesc15-PassExistingRoleToNewLambdaThenInvoke-user\"\n  path = \"/\"\n  tags = {\n    \"ManagedBy\" = \"SSO\"\n  }\n}\n",
  "fix_summary": "Added a tag to indicate that this IAM user should be managed through SSO, as a minimal step to address the issue. However, replacing IAM users with SSO or federated access is the recommended long-term solution."
}
